<h2>Getting Started with Learn & Earn Hub</h2>

<p>
Learn & Earn Hub helps people develop practical skills, discover earning opportunities,
and connect with local communities.
</p>

<h3>Step 1: Create an Account</h3>
<p>
Register for free and create your learner profile.
</p>

<h3>Step 2: Explore Courses</h3>
<p>
Browse educational content covering freelancing, digital skills,
business, communication, and technology.
</p>

<h3>Step 3: Complete Learning Activities</h3>
<p>
Track your progress and build useful knowledge through structured learning.
</p>

<h3>Step 4: Connect with Opportunities</h3>
<p>
Use the marketplace and community features to promote services,
discover opportunities, and grow your skills.
</p>

<h3>Our Mission</h3>
<p>
Our mission is to provide accessible learning resources that help people
improve their knowledge, develop professional skills, and create new opportunities.
</p>
